body:
@assaf758, I can't reproduce with the .vimrc file.

I run with nvim -u init.vim.txt init.vim.txt, install plugins with PlugInstall, restart, run `:help grepper`, and I am not seeing any segfault. I do however see some plugins, like plugins for Ruby, output warnings.

I think the situation requires from you to find a minimal workable example that causes this bug. Delete lines one from the file and send a minimal file such that removing any line from it does not cause the bug to appear. Also try to see if running it in fresh environment also causes this bug.
